# Old Man of the Sea's ability targets a "creature with power less than or equal to this creature's power" (CR 115.1, 601.2c):
# Bot2's Hullbreacher (power 3) is refused, while Llanowar Elves (power 1) is a legal target, and Old Man takes it. Then
# Bot2 bolts Old Man: "You lose control of the creature if the Old Man leaves the battlefield. This is because it is no
# longer tapped" (its ruling; CR 611.2b, 400.7): the Elves is Bot2's again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Island
Old Man of the Sea
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Hullbreacher
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Forest x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Old Man of the Sea.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Hullbreacher.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Hullbreacher)
Bot1.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Island
Bot1.Graveyard = Old Man of the Sea
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Llanowar Elves; Hullbreacher
